  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000039',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000010','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "每家 JD 侧重不同，别用一份模板投所有岗。"}}]}',0,0,4,'2026-06-03T23:15:00.000Z','2026-06-07T21:20:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000040',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000011','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "把半导体产业的地缘背景串起来了，读完对设备和材料的卡点有了概念。"}}]}',0,0,1,'2025-12-21T14:10:00.000Z','2026-01-15T21:30:00.000Z'),
  ('eeeeeeee-eeee-4eee-8eee-000000000041',NULL,'bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-000000000011','paragraph','{"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "写工艺代际那几章有点粗，不过大方向清楚。"}}]}',0,0,2,'2025-12-21T14:10:00.000Z','2026-01-15T21:30:00.000Z'),
